---
const robuReady = Boolean(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ROBU_REFERRAL_PARAM?.trim() && import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ROBU_REFERRAL_ID?.trim());
const amazonReady = Boolean(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_AMAZON_IN_TAG?.trim() || import.meta.env.PUBLIC_AMAZON_US_TAG?.trim());
const paymentUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_PAYMENT_LINK?.trim();
const sponsorsUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GITHUB_SPONSORS_URL?.trim();
const inquiryUrl = 'https://github.com/athrvuchil-svg/lets-build-robots/issues/new?title=Paid%20robot%20build%20review&body=Project%20or%20BOM%3A%0AWhat%20you%20want%20checked%3A%0ATimeline%3A%0ABudget%3A';
---

<section class="lbr-earn-plan" data-earn-plan>
  <div class="lbr-earn-status lbr-card">
    <div><p class="lbr-kicker">Revenue switchboard</p><h2>Turn useful attention into honest revenue.</h2><p class="lbr-muted-copy">The site is free for learners. Money comes from disclosed referrals, paid build reviews, and clearly labeled partner placements.</p></div>
    <span class:list={{ 'lbr-status-badge': true, 'is-good': robuReady || amazonReady || paymentUrl || sponsorsUrl, 'is-warn': !(robuReady || amazonReady || paymentUrl || sponsorsUrl) }}>{robuReady || amazonReady || paymentUrl || sponsorsUrl ? 'PARTLY CONNECTED' : 'SETUP NEEDED'}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="lbr-earn-grid">
    <article class="lbr-earn-card lbr-card"><span class="lbr-earn-number">01 · TODAY</span><h3>Sell a build review</h3><p>Offer an async BOM, power, and pin review for a beginner or student team. Start with a small fixed scope and quote the final price before work begins.</p><strong>Suggested starting menu</strong><ul><li>₹499 · written BOM sanity check</li><li>₹1,499 · BOM + wiring review</li><li>₹2,999 · 45-minute build session</li></ul><a class="lbr-button lbr-button-primary" href={inquiryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Take a review inquiry ↗</a></article>
    <article class="lbr-earn-card lbr-card"><span class="lbr-earn-number">02 · AFTER APPROVAL</span><h3>Earn on parts people already need</h3><p>Apply to the retailer programs first. Never turn a safety verdict into a paid recommendation; only decorate links after the merchant accepts you.</p><ul><li class:list={{ 'is-connected': robuReady }}>Robu referral: {robuReady ? 'connected at build time' : 'ID not configured'}</li><li class:list={{ 'is-connected': amazonReady }}>Amazon Associates: {amazonReady ? 'tag configured' : 'tag not configured'}</li></ul><div class="lbr-earn-actions"><a class="lbr-button lbr-button-quiet" href="https://robu.in/affiliate-area/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check Robu affiliate ↗</a><a class="lbr-button lbr-button-quiet" href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.in/signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apply to Amazon.in ↗</a></div></article>
    <article class="lbr-earn-card lbr-card"><span class="lbr-earn-number">03 · THIS WEEK</span><h3>Sell a small digital kit</h3><p>Package one proven path: a printable wiring checklist, a Forge BOM, and a short build guide. Payment must be collected through an account you own.</p>{paymentUrl ? <a class="lbr-button lbr-button-primary" href={paymentUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open your payment link ↗</a> : <a class="lbr-button lbr-button-quiet" href="https://razorpay.com/payment-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Create a Razorpay link ↗</a>}<small class="lbr-earn-note">{paymentUrl ? 'Payment link is configured for this build.' : 'No payment URL is configured yet; this button is setup guidance.'}</small></article>
    <article class="lbr-earn-card lbr-card"><span class="lbr-earn-number">04 · OUTREACH</span><h3>Sell access to the audience</h3><p>Offer a labeled placement to robotics shops, kit makers, clubs, and workshop organizers. Promise distribution and a useful lesson—not a fake engineering endorsement.</p>{sponsorsUrl ? <a class="lbr-button lbr-button-primary" href={sponsorsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Support LBR ↗</a> : <a class="lbr-button lbr-button-quiet" href="https://github.com/athrvuchil-svg/lets-build-robots/issues/new?title=Partnership%20inquiry&body=Brand%20or%20kit%3A%0AAudience%20offer%3A%0ABudget%3A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a partner lead ↗</a>}<small class="lbr-earn-note">Paid placements remain labeled and separate from deterministic safety checks.</small></article>
  </div>

  <div class="lbr-earn-config lbr-card"><strong>Build-time connection</strong><code>PUBLIC_ROBU_REFERRAL_PARAM=… PUBLIC_ROBU_REFERRAL_ID=… PUBLIC_AMAZON_IN_TAG=… PUBLIC_PAYMENT_LINK=…</code><p>These are public referral identifiers, not secrets. Add them to your deployment environment only after the relevant program approves your account. See <a href="https://github.com/athrvuchil-svg/lets-build-robots/blob/master/MONETIZATION.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MONETIZATION.md</a> for the launch checklist.</p></div>
</section>
